      "releaseNotes": "Fixed the app closing when you start recording in movie mode on some iPhones, including iPhone 18 Pro. If a recording won't start, the app now tries again right away with simpler settings.\nTap the film-advance lever for settings: a self-timer (3 or 10 seconds) and, on iPhones that have it, high-resolution capture (up to 48 MP).\nYou can now shoot with the volume buttons, and with Camera Control on iPhone 16 and later. On the clockwork movie cameras, hold the lever to wind the spring.",
